  "story_t1_enemy": "Patrol recruit: The harbor is closed! Turn back, pirates!",
  "story_t1_ally": "Octo: Pirates? We were just fixing our boat… Fine, have a bomb!",
  "story_t2_enemy": "Patrol recruit: We'll keep our distance and fire! Catch us if you can!",
  "story_t2_ally": "Tok: The wind pushes your shots. Read it, then choose when to close in or fall back.",
  "story_t3_enemy": "Patrol diver: Good luck aiming on these rough waves!",
  "story_t3_ally": "Tok: Let's move to calm water. Our lookout hits hard, but falls if the mast breaks!",
  "story_s1_1_enemy": "Patrol guard: Pirate inspection. Where are you going in that wreck?",
  "story_s1_1_ally": "Octo: We built this ship with our own hands. Don't call it a wreck!",
  "story_s1_2_enemy": "Patrol guard: We brought a harpooner. Hiding behind walls won't help.",
  "story_s1_2_ally": "Suri: Watch my stone skip. Aim for the waterline, right?",
  "story_s1_3_enemy": "Patrol scout: The parrot will find you. There's nowhere to hide.",
  "story_s1_3_ally": "Octo: Then let's finish before we spring a leak. Fast!",
  "story_s1_4_enemy": "Patrol gunner: Four of us firing and your deck won't survive.",
  "story_s1_4_ally": "Polly: The sky is mine! I'll dive on them from above.",
  "story_s1_5_enemy": "Crab Lieutenant: See the iron bow? Half of every shot bounces right off!",
  "story_s1_5_ally": "Tok: If the front is hard, hit from above or below.",
  "story_s1_6_enemy": "Patrol shocker: One hammer blow and your ship drifts into rough water!",
  "story_s1_6_ally": "Tok: If we get pushed, we sail back to calm water. Fuel refills every turn.",
  "story_s1_7_enemy": "Patrol sniper: From the masthead I can see right into your cabins.",
  "story_s1_7_ally": "Octo: Bring down that lookout and the sniper falls with it. Aim for the mast!",
  "story_s1_8_enemy": "Crab bosun: The waves out here are wild. Good luck aiming!",
  "story_s1_8_ally": "Suri: When the ship rocks, release at the top where it pauses.",
  "story_s1_9_enemy": "Crab raiders: We'll leap onto your deck and finish you with our claws!",
  "story_s1_9_ally": "Pang: If they board, blast the planks they stand on. No footing, and into the sea they go!",
  "story_s1_10_enemy": "Patrol gull scout: The wind is on our side today. Your shots will all miss!",
  "story_s1_10_ally": "Polly: Watch which way the clouds drift. Ride the wind and fly farther!",
  "story_s1_11_enemy": "Patrol first mate: You won't reach the captain. I'll sink you all right here.",
  "story_s1_11_ally": "Octo: Wind, waves, lookout… let's use everything we learned. The first shard is close!",
  "story_s1_12_enemy": "Patrol captain: You'll never take the heart shard. The cutter is closing in!",
  "story_s1_12_ally": "Octo: The first shard is ours. Everyone, fire!",
